OGRE 14 prerequisite patch. Preserve LF line endings for git apply --recount.

Fix: release cached GL3Plus programs before their manager and context are destroyed.

The program manager owns separable programs whose destructors consult its singleton.
Destroy them while the singleton and GL context are still alive, before render target
shutdown removes the primary context. Shutdown can also run before initialisation.

diff --git a/RenderSystems/GL3Plus/src/OgreGL3PlusRenderSystem.cpp b/RenderSystems/GL3Plus/src/OgreGL3PlusRenderSystem.cpp
--- a/RenderSystems/GL3Plus/src/OgreGL3PlusRenderSystem.cpp
+++ b/RenderSystems/GL3Plus/src/OgreGL3PlusRenderSystem.cpp
@@ -569,3 +569,8 @@ namespace Ogre {
+    //! Releases cached programs while the manager and GL context are still alive.
     void GL3PlusRenderSystem::shutdown(void)
     {
+        // Cached separable programs need the manager singleton and current GL context during destruction.
+        if (mProgramManager)
+            mProgramManager->destroyAllPrograms();
+
         RenderSystem::shutdown();
